WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.937
Welcome to Module 13, Statistics and Visualization.

00:00:04.937 --> 00:00:10.102
In Module 12, we focused on cleaning and validating data.

00:00:10.102 --> 00:00:15.017
Now we are ready to ask what the cleaned data is actually telling us.

00:00:15.017 --> 00:00:18.357
Statistics gives us numerical summaries.

00:00:18.357 --> 00:00:26.302
Visualization helps us see distributions, differences, trends, and relationships that may be difficult to notice in a

00:00:26.302 --> 00:00:27.729
table.

00:00:28.212 --> 00:00:33.529
The goal is not to calculate every statistic or create as many charts as possible.

00:00:33.529 --> 00:00:39.559
The goal is to choose the statistic and visual that answer the analytical question clearly.

00:00:39.559 --> 00:00:46.519
Throughout this module, we will use a small order dataset and examine it from several perspectives.

00:00:46.519 --> 00:00:52.163
By the end, you should be able to describe numeric data, compare groups, study relationships,

00:00:52.163 --> 00:00:59.483
choose an appropriate chart, and write interpretations that match the strength of the evidence.
